    {
      "Name": "CardTypes_Labels_EnableTextRecognitionInFileHint",
      "Comment": "Сообщение лейбла о том, что в файле включено распознавание текста",
      "Strings": [
        {
          "Culture": "en",
          "Value": "Set this checkbox if you want to enable text recognition in the file. You also need to enable the TextRecognitionCollectorPlugin plugin in the app-plugins.json configuration settings."
        },
        {
          "Culture": "ru",
          "Value": "Установите данный признак, если необходимо включить распознавание текста в файле. Также необходимо включить плагин TextRecognitionCollectorPlugin в настройках конфигурации app-plugins.json."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Name": "CardTypes_Labels_PatternsHint",
      "Comment": "Сообщение лейбла об использовании шаблона",
      "Strings": [
        {
          "Culture": "en",
          "Value": "The pattern is specified by a regular expression, which must contain named groups. The order of the groups can be arbitrary, but the group names must match the fixed names:\n- named groups for boolean values: <positive> - positive value, <negative> - negative value;\n- named groups for numeric values: <sign> - number sign (optional for positive), <integer> - integer part of the number, <fractional> - fractional part of the number;\n- named groups for date and time: <year> - year, <month> - month, <day> - day, <minutes> - minutes, <seconds> - seconds, <am> - ante meridiem, <pm> - post meridiem."
        },
